From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: brennoflavio <contato@brennoflavio.com.br>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 16:20:26 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] webapi: add native media source and recorder capability
 probes

Expose MediaSource and MediaRecorder with codec-aware static MIME probes
for the desktop Mac Chrome persona, independent of host codecs. Preserve
native EventTarget inheritance, argument coercion, invalid-receiver checks,
and standard closed/inactive-state exceptions.

Provide independently retained empty SourceBufferLists, dedicated-worker
MediaSource/handle exposure, and empty native MediaStreams for recorder
construction. Keep callback cycles collectible and clean up once/abort
listeners. Attachment, handle transfer, live tracks and encoding remain
outside this capability patch.

Pass media-source-recorder-capabilities: benchmark 124/130 with no prior
passes regressed; existing upstream tests 1658/1658. Validate 256 temporary
API/GC checks in the debug build. Address reviewer findings for extended
VP9/AV1 strings, buffer-list iteration and BigInt rejection.
